    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="42">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 42</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XXXVIII} Eac we beodæð: se mon se ðe his gefán hamsittendne wite, þæt he ne feohte, ærðam he him ryhtes bidde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Likewise we command: for the man who knows that his enemy is sitting at home, that he not fight him before he offers to settle according to law.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">Also we enjoin, that a man who knows his adversary to be residing at home, shall not have recourse to violence before demanding justice of him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XXXVIII. Eac we beodað: se mon se ðe his gefán hamsittende wite, ðæt he ne feohte, ær ðam ðe he him ryhtes bidde.</ab>
      </div>
